ES VIEWER & LOCAL EDITOR\n- View and modify object attributes (Size, Position, Transparency, Text, etc.).\n- Edit local values to test UI changes, map modifications, or client-side behaviors.\n- Seamlessly read hidden attributes and object tags.\n\n[+] SCRIPT DECOMPILER & VIEWER\n- Open LocalScripts and ModuleScripts to view their source code directly in-game.\n- Copy script code or export structures for external analysis.\n- Syntax highlighting built into the UI for easy code reading.\n\n[+] PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATION\n- Built-in Virtual Scrolling to load directories with 30,000+ objects instantly.\n- Low-memory footprint prevents client-side lagging or crashes during massive game loads.\n\n[+] REMOTE DATA INTERCEPTION\n- Deep tracking of RemoteEvents and RemoteFunctions fired between client and server.\n- Log, inspect, and analyze exact arguments, parameters, and payloads sent.\n\n[+] SECURITY CAMOUFLAGE\n- Bypasses standard game detection by randomizing the UI instance names.\n- Renders directly to protected screen layers to avoid simple screenshot loggers.\n============================================================","tags":["Keyless","GUI","RobloxD","Mobile Features and PcD"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a504bf8679f689645498c36","username":"AHAX","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6fb08db3923eeb079a269caa3c7e101b4529a01819c71f8c465ad2bc1fef4760.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a504bf8679f689645498c36-1784942631597.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6a504bf8679f689645498c36","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6fb08db3923eeb079a269caa3c7e101b4529a01819c71f8c465ad2bc1fef4760.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a504bf8679f689645498c36-1784942631597.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false